  <body>
    <div id="root"><div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-bg"><header><nav class="px-gutter py-[18px] flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-7"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-[21px] font-semibold text-text no-underline leading-none" href="/" data-discover="true" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em;"><span class="w-[3px] h-[18px] bg-vermillion inline-block"></span><span class="translate-y-[1.5px] inline-block">Marketlens</span></a><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-7 text-[14px] font-medium text-text-secondary leading-none"><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/data" data-discover="true">Data</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/docs" data-discover="true">Documentation</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/guides" data-discover="true">Guides</a><a href="/#pricing" class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text">Pricing</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/compare" data-discover="true">Compare</a><a href="https://github.com/marketlenstrade/marketlens-python" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text">GitHub</a></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="hidden md:block"><a class="text-[13px] font-semibold bg-text text-bg px-5 py-2 transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-85" href="/?signin=1" data-discover="true">Sign in</a></div><button class="md:hidden w-8 h-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[5px]" aria-label="Open menu"><span class="block w-[18px] h-[2px] bg-text origin-center" style="transform: none;"></span><span class="block w-[18px] h-[2px] bg-text origin-center" style="transform: none;"></span></button></div></nav><div class="border-b border-border"></div></header><main class="flex-1"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What data does Marketlens provide?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Marketlens provides tick-level Polymarket order book snapshots and deltas, executed trades, OHLCV candles, reference prices, and derived signals such as implied probability surfaces across multi-outcome markets. Data is accessed through a Python SDK or a REST API at api.marketlens.trade."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is this different from Polymarket's own CLOB API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Polymarket's CLOB API serves current state and trade streams. Marketlens stores full historical order book snapshots and deltas, lets you replay books at millisecond resolution, and exposes derived analytics and a backtesting harness, none of which the upstream CLOB API provides. See marketlens.trade/compare for a comparison with other Polymarket data providers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I backtest strategies with realistic fills?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The Marketlens backtest harness replays historical order books with real queue priority, configurable latency, and slippage modeling, so fills reflect what your orders would have actually gotten rather than mid-price assumptions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does Marketlens cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free tier includes 600 requests/minute and 25M data rows/day with one API key, no card required. Pro is $348/year or $39/month for 3,600 requests/min and 5B rows/month across 5 keys. Scale is $1,788/year or $199/month for 10,800 requests/min and 50B rows/month across 25 keys. All tiers access the same endpoints."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get started?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Install the Python SDK with `pip install marketlens`, grab a free API key from the console, and you can list markets, fetch order books, and run a backtest in under a minute. See the Getting Started docs at marketlens.trade/docs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I get Polymarket historical order book data?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Marketlens publishes Polymarket order book historical data as tick-level L2 snapshots and deltas at millisecond resolution. Access it via the Python SDK, REST API at api.marketlens.trade/v1, or bulk Parquet exports at marketlens.trade/docs/exports."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Marketlens provide a Polymarket orderbook API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The Marketlens orderbook API returns full-depth L2 snapshots, lets you walk historical books tick-by-tick, and computes spread, midpoint, and depth metrics. See marketlens.trade/docs/orderbook."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I replay Polymarket order books historically?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The orderbook.walk() endpoint replays Polymarket order books tick-by-tick over any time range, reconstructing book state from stored snapshots and deltas. It powers the backtesting harness and can be used directly for research."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I download Polymarket trades history and price data?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Polymarket executed trades and OHLCV candles are available via the /trades and /candles endpoints, or as bulk Parquet exports. Reference prices and midpoints are available at marketlens.trade/docs/reference-prices."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far back does the Polymarket historical data go?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Order book history starts on 2026-03-01, with continuous coverage since 2026-04-13. The earliest candles date to 2026-02-28, and there are a few gap days in March and April 2026. Esports and standalone event coverage (including the 2028 election markets) begins 2026-08-15. Each market's temporalCoverage field reports its earliest captured snapshot."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a Python SDK for Polymarket market data?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. `pip install marketlens`. The SDK wraps markets, orderbook, trades, candles, exports, reference prices, and a backtesting harness. Source: github.com/marketlenstrade/marketlens-python."}}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Marketlens","item":"https://marketlens.trade/"}]}</script><section class="py-section px-gutter relative overflow-visible"><canvas class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 w-full pointer-events-none hidden md:block" aria-hidden="true" width="800" height="624" style="height: 150%;"></canvas><div class="max-w-page mx-auto relative"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter"><div><h1 class="font-display text-[32px] md:text-[40px] lg:text-hero text-text" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);">Backtest your Polymarket bot on historical order books.</h1><p class="font-body text-[16px] md:text-[18px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);">Tick-level order book history, backtesting SDK, and structured analytics for Polymarket. From intraday crypto to structured products and live sports.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-3 mt-6" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="text-[13px] font-semibold bg-text text-bg px-5 py-2 transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-85 no-underline" href="/?signin=1" data-discover="true">Get API Key</a><a href="/docs" class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-text-secondary border border-border px-5 py-2 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text hover:border-text no-underline">Read the Docs</a></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block"></div></div></div></section><section class="py-section px-gutter"><div class="max-w-page mx-auto"><div class="" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="section-label mb-3">Capabilities</p><h2 class="font-display text-section text-text">Ready to start trading?</h2></div><div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 divide-y lg:divide-y-0 lg:divide-x divide-border-light border-y border-border-light"><div class="py-5 lg:px-6 first:lg:pl-0 last:lg:pr-0 transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Millisecond replay</p><p class="font-body text-[14px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-2">Replay the full order book at millisecond resolution. Every level, every tick, nothing interpolated.</p></div><div class="py-5 lg:px-6 first:lg:pl-0 last:lg:pr-0 transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Real-depth backtesting</p><p class="font-body text-[14px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-2">Backtest against historical books with real queue priority, latency, and slippage.</p></div><div class="py-5 lg:px-6 first:lg:pl-0 last:lg:pr-0 transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Probability surfaces</p><p class="font-body text-[14px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-2">Extract implied distributions and survival curves across multi-outcome markets.</p></div><div class="py-5 lg:px-6 first:lg:pl-0 last:lg:pr-0 transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Self-healing collection</p><p class="font-body text-[14px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-2">Verified against CLOB ground truth with automatic reseed on drift and redundant connections.</p></div></div></div></section><section aria-label="Platform statistics" class="px-gutter"><div class="max-w-page mx-auto border-y border-border-light"><div class="flex flex-wrap lg:flex-nowrap"><div class="relative flex-1 basis-1/3 sm:basis-auto" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-5 md:py-6" aria-label="Book Updates: --"><span class="font-display text-[22px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] text-text tabular-nums tracking-tight leading-none">--</span><span class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-text-tertiary tracking-widest mt-1.5">Book Updates</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center" aria-hidden="true"><div class="w-px h-8 bg-border-light"></div></div><div class="relative flex-1 basis-1/3 sm:basis-auto" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-5 md:py-6" aria-label="Markets Tracked: --"><span class="font-display text-[22px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] text-text tabular-nums tracking-tight leading-none">--</span><span class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-text-tertiary tracking-widest mt-1.5">Markets Tracked</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center" aria-hidden="true"><div class="w-px h-8 bg-border-light"></div></div><div class="relative flex-1 basis-1/3 sm:basis-auto" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-5 md:py-6" aria-label="Trades Recorded: --"><span class="font-display text-[22px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] text-text tabular-nums tracking-tight leading-none">--</span><span class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-text-tertiary tracking-widest mt-1.5">Trades Recorded</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center" aria-hidden="true"><div class="w-px h-8 bg-border-light"></div></div><div class="relative flex-1 basis-1/2 sm:basis-auto" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-5 md:py-6" aria-label="Events / Second: --"><span class="font-display text-[22px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] text-text tabular-nums tracking-tight leading-none">--</span><span class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-text-tertiary tracking-widest mt-1.5">Events / Second</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-section px-gutter"><div class="max-w-page mx-auto"><div class="" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="section-label mb-3">Explore</p><h2 class="section-headline">See the data. Build with it.</h2><p class="font-body text-[16px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3 max-w-[640px]">Replay tick-level order books or backtest strategies against real historical data.</p></div><div class="" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><div class="border border-border bg-bg-contrast overflow-hidden mt-10"><div class="flex border-b border-white/[0.06]"><button class="font-mono uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors duration-200 text-vermillion border-b-2 border-vermillion -mb-px">Order Book</button><button class="font-mono uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors duration-200 text-[#9A9288]/60 hover:text-[#9A9288]">Backtest</button></div><div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3" style="height: 294px;"><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-[#9A9288]/40 tracking-widest">Failed to load order book data</p><button class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Retry</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-section px-gutter bg-bg-contrast text-white"><div class="max-w-page mx-auto"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter items-center"><div class="" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="section-label mb-3 opacity-80">Quick Start</p><h2 class="font-display text-section text-white">Billions of ticks. One SDK.</h2><p class="font-body text-[16px] text-white/50 leading-relaxed mt-3">Hunt edges, not bugs. Tick-by-tick replay with simulated fills, fees, and latency.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-3 mt-8"><a href="/?signin=1" class="text-[13px] font-semibold bg-vermillion text-white px-5 py-2 transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-85 no-underline">Get API Key</a><a href="/docs" class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-white/60 border border-white/20 px-5 py-2 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white hover:border-white/40 no-underline">Read the Docs</a></div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-white/40 mt-5">Or hand it to an agent via the <a href="/docs/mcp" class="text-vermillion underline transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-80">MCP server</a>. The SDK is <a href="https://github.com/marketlenstrade/marketlens-python" class="text-vermillion underline transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-80">open source on GitHub</a>.</p></div><div class="" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><div class="border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03]"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 h-[36px] border-b border-white/[0.06]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-[#9A9288]/60 tracking-widest">python</span></div><button class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-[#9A9288]/60 tracking-widest transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#9A9288]">Copy</button></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex overflow-x-auto"><div class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.8] py-4 pl-4 pr-3 select-none text-right shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" style="color: rgba(232, 228, 220, 0.35);"><div>1</div><div>2</div><div>3</div><div>4</div><div>5</div><div>6</div><div>7</div><div>8</div><div>9</div><div>10</div><div>11</div><div>12</div><div>13</div><div>14</div><div>15</div><div>16</div><div>17</div><div>18</div><div>19</div><div>20</div><div>21</div><div>22</div></div><div class="py-4 pr-4 min-w-0"><code class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.8] block whitespace-pre" style="color: rgb(232, 228, 220);"><span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">from</span> marketlens <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">import</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">MarketLens</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Strategy</span>

<span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">class</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">AskHeavyFader</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Strategy</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">):</span>

    <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">def</span> __init__<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">self</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">):</span>
        <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">self</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>_entered <span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">False</span>

    <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">def</span> on_market_start<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">self</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> ctx<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> market<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> book<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">):</span>
        <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">self</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>_entered <span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">False</span>

    <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">def</span> on_trade<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">self</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> ctx<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> market<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> book<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> trade<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">):</span>
        <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">if</span> book<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>imbalance<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(29, 92, 92);">5</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">)</span> <span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">&lt;</span> <span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">-</span><span style="color: rgb(29, 92, 92);">0.2</span> <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">and</span> <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">not</span> <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">self</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>_entered<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">:</span>
            ctx<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>buy_no<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span>size<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(29, 92, 92);">100</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">)</span>
            <span style="color: rgb(196, 75, 40);">self</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>_entered <span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">True</span>

client <span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">MarketLens</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(42, 122, 122);">"&lt;API KEY&gt;"</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">)</span>
result <span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span> client<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>backtest<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span>
    <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">AskHeavyFader</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(),</span> <span style="color: rgb(42, 122, 122);">"btc-up-or-down-5m"</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span>
    after<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(42, 122, 122);">"2026-04-15T12:00:00Z"</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> before<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(42, 122, 122);">"2026-04-15T18:00:00Z"</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span>
    initial_cash<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(29, 92, 92);">10_000</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> data_dir<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(42, 122, 122);">"data"</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span>
<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">)</span>
result<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">.</span>save<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(42, 122, 122);">"runs/btc-fader"</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">,</span> overwrite<span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">=</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">True</span><span style="color: rgb(154, 146, 136);">)</span></code></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-full pointer-events-none md:hidden" aria-hidden="true" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(27, 25, 21, 0.6));"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="coverage" class="pt-section pb-12 px-gutter"><div class="max-w-page mx-auto"><div class="" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="section-label mb-3">Coverage</p><h2 class="font-display text-section text-text">What's in the box?</h2><p class="font-body text-[16px] text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-[520px]">Every recurring product family, plus any event that sustains real trading volume.</p></div><div class="mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 border-t border-l border-border-light max-w-[960px]"><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/category/crypto" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Crypto</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Up or down windows, strike ladders, barriers</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">BTC · ETH · SOL · XRP · DOGE</p></a></div><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/category/sports" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Sports</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Live books through every game</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">NBA · NFL · MLB · NHL · tennis · soccer · UFC</p></a></div><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/category/esports" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Esports</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Match and map winners, live through every series</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">League of Legends · Dota 2 · Counter-Strike · Valorant</p></a></div><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/events" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Politics &amp; events</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Elections, geopolitics, standalone questions</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">elections · nominations · world leaders</p></a></div><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/category/weather" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Weather</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Daily temperature buckets by city</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">NYC · London · Tokyo · 50+ cities</p></a></div><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/category/economy" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Macro &amp; economy</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Central banks, economic prints, releases</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">FOMC · CPI · GDP · jobs</p></a></div><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/category/equities" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Equities</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Earnings, hit price, and up or down markets</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">SPY · META · PLTR · earnings</p></a></div><div class="contents" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><a class="block h-full bg-bg px-5 py-4 border-r border-b border-border-light transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-vermillion-soft" href="/data/category/indices" data-discover="true"><div class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-vermillion">Indices &amp; commodities</div><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-secondary mt-1.5 leading-snug">Index levels and commodity strikes</p><p class="font-mono text-[12px] text-text-tertiary mt-2 leading-relaxed">S&amp;P 500 · Nasdaq · gold · crude oil</p></a></div></div><div class="" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-text-tertiary mt-5 max-w-[640px] leading-relaxed">The recurring families are tracked continuously at full L2 depth, and any Polymarket event sustaining $10,000 in 24 hour trading volume is admitted automatically. Per series coverage, market counts, and resolution splits are in the <a class="text-vermillion underline transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-vermillion-deep" href="/data" data-discover="true">data catalog</a>.</p></div></div></section><section id="pricing" class="py-section px-gutter bg-bg-contrast text-white"><div class="max-w-page mx-auto"><div class="text-center" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="section-label mb-3 opacity-80">Pricing</p><h2 class="font-display text-section text-white">Simple, transparent pricing.</h2><p class="font-body text-[15px] text-white/45 mt-2 max-w-[420px] mx-auto">All tiers access the same data and endpoints. Limits are per-user, aggregated across keys.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mt-6"><button class="font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-200 text-white/30 hover:text-white/50">Monthly</button><button class="relative w-[40px] h-[22px] bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/[0.06] cursor-pointer flex-shrink-0" aria-label="Switch to monthly billing"><div class="absolute top-[3px] w-[14px] h-[14px] bg-vermillion"></div></button><button class="font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-200 text-white">Annual</button><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-vermillion tracking-wider uppercase" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-4px);">3 months free</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-px mt-10"><div class="relative flex flex-col p-6 border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-white/[0.05]" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40">Free</p><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-white/35 mt-1">Explore the data</p><div class="mt-4 mb-5 flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="font-mono text-[36px] font-bold text-white leading-none">Free</span></div><ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 flex-1"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>25M data rows / day</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>600 requests / min</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>1 API key</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>Bulk exports included</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>Full history &amp; SDK access</li></ul><button class="block w-full text-center font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold py-2.5 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer border border-white/20 text-white/60 hover:text-white hover:border-white/40">Get Started</button></div><div class="relative flex flex-col p-6 border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-white/[0.05] border-l-3 border-l-vermillion" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><span class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-vermillion text-white font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1">Popular</span><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40">Pro</p><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-white/35 mt-1">For researchers &amp; traders</p><div class="mt-4 mb-5 flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-white/30">$</span><span class="font-mono text-[36px] font-bold text-white leading-none tabular-nums" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px);">29</span><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-white/30">/mo</span></div><ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 flex-1"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-vermillion">✓</span>5B data rows / month</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-vermillion">✓</span>3,600 requests / min</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-vermillion">✓</span>Unused rows roll over one month</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-vermillion">✓</span>5 API keys</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-vermillion">✓</span>Priority support</li></ul><button class="block w-full text-center font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold py-2.5 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-vermillion text-white hover:opacity-85">Subscribe</button></div><div class="relative flex flex-col p-6 border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.03] transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-white/[0.05]" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px);"><p class="font-mono text-label uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40">Scale</p><p class="font-body text-[13px] text-white/35 mt-1">For teams &amp; trading desks</p><div class="mt-4 mb-5 flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-white/30">$</span><span class="font-mono text-[36px] font-bold text-white leading-none tabular-nums" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px);">149</span><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-white/30">/mo</span></div><ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 flex-1"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>50B data rows / month</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>10,800 requests / min</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>Unused rows roll over one month</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>25 API keys</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13px] text-white/45 leading-snug"><span class="mt-px flex-shrink-0 text-[11px] text-white/20">✓</span>Dedicated support</li></ul><button class="block w-full text-center font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold py-2.5 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer border border-white/20 text-white/60 hover:text-white hover:border-white/40">Subscribe</button></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="border-t-2 border-text px-gutter py-6 text-[13px] text-text-tertiary"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4"><span>© 2026 Marketlens</span><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2"><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/data" data-discover="true">Data</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/docs" data-discover="true">Documentation</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/guides" data-discover="true">Guides</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text" href="/compare" data-discover="true">Compare</a><a href="https://github.com/marketlenstrade/marketlens-python" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text">GitHub</a><a href="https://huggingface.co/marketlens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-text">Hugging Face</a><a href="http